      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ASTON FIXER (7) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (24.27) at Traralgon behind Night Sharid in a Grade 5. Chased the leaders and with a clean run can be prominent. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from four attempts. Deserves serious consideration. TEQUILA BLINDER (2) has some solid form under his belt and proved too strong last time to win by 0.8 lengths at this track in a handy 25.46 beating Hooked And Happy. The form out of last race has been strong. One of main contenders. PAW URLA (5) looks close to another win after finishing second from Box 6 last time (25.33) at this track. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Leading chance. SHE'S PRIMED (8) was out of the money here last time out but can bounce back.",
